TI  - Comparing 2-Hz and 100-Hz Electroacupuncture for Postoperative Musculoskeletal Pain: Protocol for a 2 × 2 Prospective Randomized Crossover Trial.
AU  - Park, Jeong Hwan
AU  - Jun, Hyeong Joon
AU  - Kim, Young-Eun
AU  - Lee, Sanghun
AU  - Kim, Daehyeok
AU  - Choi, Sunmi
