TI  - [Transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation reduces perioperative arrhythmia risk and improves recovery quality in laparoscopic cholecystectomy: mechanisms involving suppression of repolarization abnormalities induced by CO2 pneumoperitoneum].
AU  - Tian, Ming-de
AU  - Gao, Hong
