TI  - Effectiveness of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation for postoperative nausea, vomiting and pain in cancer patients: a systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials.
AU  - Chu, Jie
AU  - You, Jiangxue
AU  - Li, Ruiqi
AU  - Wu, Zhe
AU  - Liu, Chang
AU  - Tian, Chao
T2  - Frontiers in medicine
