TI  - Efficacy of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation for the treatment of gastrointestinal dysfunction in patients after cardiac surgery with cardiopulmonary bypass: study protocol for a superiority, single-centre, single-blind, randomised controlled clinical trial.
