TI  - Efficacy of Transcutaneous Electrical Acupoint Stimulation Applied During the Post-Anesthesia Recovery Period in Improving Postoperative Recovery Quality After Gynecological Laparoscopic Surgery: A Randomized Controlled Trial.
AU  - Zhou, Zhihu
AU  - Yang, Xiang
AU  - Shi, Min
AU  - Huang, Liqiao
