TI  - Effectiveness of P6 Stimulation and Transdermal Scopolamine Patch for the Reduction of Nausea and Vomiting During Caesarean Section Under Combined Spinal-Epidural Anesthesia: A Randomized Clinical Trial.
AU  - Levin, Danielle
AU  - Levin, Sarah
AU  - Cohen, Shaul
T2  - Journal of clinical medicine
JF  - Journal of clinical medicine
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/04/07
