TI  - Does perioperative electroacupuncture reduce postoperative pain in dogs undergoing ovariohysterectomy?
AU  - Iwe, Celine
AU  - Schiele, Anika
AU  - Passenegg, Vanessa
AU  - Corona, Daniele
AU  - Bettschart-Wolfensberger, Regula
AU  - Heitzmann, Vanessa
