TI  - Electroacupuncture improves postoperative cognitive dysfunction by inhibiting ferroptosis via the TFR1-DMT1-FPN pathway.
AU  - Chen, Tianren
AU  - Zhang, Binsen
AU  - Zhang, Xiaojia
