TI  - Effect of Transcutaneous Electrical Acupoint Stimulation on Extubation-Related Stress Response in Noncardiac Surgery Patients: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Randomized Controlled Trials.
AU  - Jiang, Mengchao
AU  - Wang, Bei
AU  - Liu, Meinv
