TI  - Effects of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation on early postoperative pain and recovery: a comprehensive systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials.
AU  - Tan, Shi-Yan
AU  - Jiang, Hua
AU  - Ma, Qiong
AU  - Ye, Xin
AU  - Fu, Xi
AU  - Ren, Yi-Feng
