TI  - [Electroacupuncture improves peripheral neuropathy by up-regulating Sirt1/PGC-1α/TFAM pathway in type 2 diabetes rats with peripheral neuropathy].
AU  - Yuan, Chong-Xi
AU  - Wang, Xuan
AU  - Yu, Zhi
AU  - Lian, Xiao-Yang
AU  - Xu, Bin
