TI  - The efficacy of transcutaneous electronic acupoint stimulation for improving postoperative recovery after gynecologic surgery: A systematic review and meta-analysis.
AU  - Ge, Yueping
AU  - Zheng, Jianhong
T2  - Medicine
JF  - Medicine
