TI  - Effects of electroacupuncture at Baihui and Dazhui on perioperative neurocognitive impairment and S100-β, LC3-II, Beclin-1 in patients with colon cancer.
AU  - Ye, Xianhua
AU  - Zheng, Saisai
AU  - Huang, Xiaoyan
AU  - Yan, Qiaoqin
