TI  - Mechanism of electroacupuncture at acupoints of the lung meridian through PKA/PKC regulation of TRPV1 in chronic cough after lung surgery in guinea pigs.
AU  - Wang, Gao-Xiang
AU  - Zhou, Jie
AU  - Chen, You-Mou
AU  - Xu, Liang-Dong
AU  - Tao, Shan-Ming
AU  - Ma, Jia
AU  - Sun, Ye-Han
