TI  - The role of acupuncture in pain and swelling control for postoperative tibial fracture treatment.
AU  - Quoc, Lam Tran
AU  - Thanh, Hang Nguyen Thi
AU  - Le Khanh, Trinh
AU  - Trung, Dung Tran
T2  - International journal of surgery case reports
JF  - International journal of surgery case reports
