TI  - Effect of Early Electroacupuncture Combined with Enhanced Recovery after Surgery (ERAS) on Pain Perception and Dysfunction in Patients after Total Knee Arthroplasty (TKA).
AU  - Zhang, Tian
AU  - Liu, Hongju
AU  - Li, Hui
AU  - He, Sha
AU  - Xiao, Li
