TI  - Efficacy and Safety of Transcutaneous Electrical Acupoint Stimulation for Postoperative Pain: A Meta-Analysis of Randomized Controlled Trials.
AU  - Wang, Dan
AU  - Shi, Hongshuo
AU  - Yang, Zhenguo
AU  - Liu, Wenbin
