TI  - Electroacupuncture for postoperative ileus after laparoscopic surgery on colorectal cancer: study protocol for a randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Shao, Jia-Kai
AU  - Liu, Qian
AU  - Pei, Wei
AU  - Wang, Yu
AU  - Yang, Na-Na
