TI  - The Feasibility of Blinding Intraoperative Electro-Auricular Acupuncture Under Neuraxial Anesthesia.
AU  - Cheng, Stephanie I
AU  - Norman, Ryan M
AU  - DeMeo, Danya
AU  - Zhong, Haoyan
AU  - Turteltaub, Lauren H
