TI  - [Effect of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation on venous thrombosis after lung cancer surgery: a randomized controlled trial].
AU  - Sun, Yue
AU  - Pang, Yong-Hui
AU  - Mao, Nai-Quan
AU  - Luo, Jie-Ning
AU  - Cai, Dao-Ling
AU  - Chen, Fei-Fei
