TI  - [Transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation relieves post-operative nausea and vomiting possibly by reducing serum motilin secretion in patients undergoing laparoscopic surgery].
AU  - Li, Jian-Li
AU  - Wang, Xue-Jiao
AU  - Rong, Jun-Fang
T2  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
JF  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
