TI  - Decreased Synovial Fluid Biomarkers Levels Are Associated with Rehabilitation of Function and Pain in Rotator Cuff Tear Patients Following Electroacupuncture Therapy.
AU  - Guan, Jian
AU  - Geng, Wei-Qiang
AU  - Li, Yao
AU  - Liu, Guang-Yuan
AU  - Ding, Luo-Bin
AU  - Liu, You-Jie
