TI  - Effectiveness and safety of polydioxanone thread-embedding acupuncture (TEA) and electroacupuncture (EA) treatment for knee osteoarthritis (KOA) patients with postoperative pain: An assessor-blinded, randomized, controlled pilot trial.
AU  - Lee, Ye Ji
AU  - Han, Chang-Hyun
AU  - Jeon, Ju Hyun
