TI  - Opposing needling for analgesia and rehabilitation after unilateral total knee arthroplasty: a randomized, sham-controlled trial protocol.
AU  - Huang, Hai
AU  - Song, Xiuling
AU  - Zhao, Ling
AU  - Zheng, Lin
