TI  - Acupuncture-like Transcutaneous Electrical Nerve Stimulation for Pain, Function, and Biochemical Inflammation After Total Knee Arthroplasty.
AU  - Kim, BeomRyong
AU  - Lohman, Everett
AU  - Yim, JongEun
T2  - Alternative therapies in health and medicine
JF  - Alternative therapies in health and medicine
PY  - 2021
