TI  - [Treatment of scapulohumeral periarthritis by Fuyang-pot warming combined with electroacupuncture stimulation].
AU  - Li, Ying-Hong
AU  - Li, Min
AU  - Li, Qiang
AU  - Guo, Yi
AU  - Liao, Xiao-Hua
AU  - Wang, Shi-Qiang
