TI  - Acupuncture for polycystic ovarian syndrome.
AU  - Lim, Chi Eung Danforn
AU  - Ng, Rachel Wai Chung
AU  - Cheng, Nga Chong Lisa
AU  - Zhang, George Shengxi
AU  - Chen, Hui
T2  - The Cochrane database of systematic reviews
