TI  - Effect of dual-acupoint and single-acupoint electric stimulation on postoperative outcomes in elderly patients subjected to gastrointestinal surgery: study protocol for a randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Lu, Zhi-Hong
AU  - Dong, Hai-Long
AU  - Huang-Fu, Jia-Wen
