TI  - Long-term electroacupuncture stimulation prevents osteoporosis in ovariectomised osteopaenic rats through multiple signalling pathways.
AU  - Zheng, Xuefeng
AU  - Nie, Yan
AU  - Sun, Chengtao
AU  - Wu, Guangwen
