TI  - Systematic Review of Three Electrical Stimulation Techniques for Rehabilitation After Total Knee Arthroplasty.
AU  - Yue, Chen
AU  - Zhang, Xue
AU  - Zhu, Yingjie
AU  - Jia, Yudong
