TI  - [Effect on Postoperative Complications of Mixed Hemorrhoids Treated with Electroacupuncture at Chengshan(BL 57), Dachangshu(BL 25)and Erbai(EX-UE 2)].
AU  - Song, Yang
AU  - Xu, Tian-Shu
AU  - Qian, Hai-Hua
