TI  - [Effects of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation on treatment and prevention of postoperative sore throat after tracheal intubation under general anesthesia].
AU  - Wang, Dongdong
AU  - Ma, Tingting
AU  - Li, Guozheng
AU  - Fan, Shanshan
T2  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
JF  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
