TI  - [A Randomized Controlled Clinical Trial for Electroacupuncture Treatment of Post-surgical Gastrointestinal Dysfunction in Patients Undergoing Laparotomy].
AU  - Pan, Hui
AU  - Li, Jia
AU  - Zhao, Yu
AU  - Li, Ning
