TI  - Influence of Electroacupuncture and Laser-Acupuncture on Treating Paresthesia in Patients Submitted to Combined Orthognathic Surgery and Genioplasty.
AU  - de Oliveira, Renata F
AU  - Goldman, Ricardo S
AU  - Mendes, Fausto Medeiros
