TI  - Autonomic Responses to Ultrasound-Guided Percutaneous Needle Electrolysis: Effect of Needle Puncture or Electrical Current?
AU  - García Bermejo, Paula
AU  - De La Cruz Torres, Blanca
AU  - Naranjo Orellana, José
AU  - Albornoz Cabello, Manuel
T2  - Journal of alternative and complementary medicine (New York, N.Y.)
JF  - Journal of alternative and complementary medicine (New York, N.Y.)
