TI  - Effect of Transcutaneous Acupoint Electrical Stimulation on Post-Hemorrhoidectomy-Associated Pain, Anxiety, and Heart Rate Variability: A Randomized-Controlled Study.
AU  - Yeh, Mei-Ling
AU  - Chung, Yu-Chu
AU  - Hsu, Lun-Chia
