TI  - Anti-inflammatory and immune regulatory effects of acupuncture after craniotomy: study protocol for a parallel-group randomized controlled trial.
AU  - Cho, Seung-Yeon
AU  - Yang, Seung-Bo
AU  - Shin, Hee Sup
AU  - Lee, Seung Hwan
AU  - Koh, Jun Seok
AU  - Kwon, Seungwon
