TI  - [Effects of Electroacupuncture at Neiguan (PC6) on Protein Expressions of Raf-1, ERK 1/2, and p-ERK 1/2 of Rats with Myocardial Hypertrophy].
AU  - Li, Jia
AU  - Wu, Song
AU  - Tang, Hong-Tu
AU  - Zhu, Guang-Wei
T2  - Zhongguo Zhong xi yi jie he za zhi Zhongguo Zhongxiyi jiehe zazhi = Chinese journal of integrated traditional and Western medicine
