TI  - [Effect of Electroacupuncture Intervention on Expression of Pain Sensory and Affective Proce- ssing-related µ-opioid Receptor, etc. in the Amygdala in Chronic Neuropathy Pain Rats].
AU  - Yan, Ya-xia
AU  - Feng, Xiu-mei
AU  - Wang, Jun-ying
AU  - Duanmu, Cheng-lin
AU  - Chen, Shu-ping
