TI  - [Protection of Transcutaneous Acupoint Electrical Stimulation for Brain Injury Undergoing Intervention: a Clinical Observation].
AU  - Yuan, Jun
AU  - Wu, Yu
AU  - Li, Ji-yong
AU  - Zhang, Li
