TI  - [Effects of electroacupuncture preconditioning on expression of nitric oxide synthase and glial fibrillary acidic protein in cortex of focal cerebral ischemia-reperfusion rats].
AU  - Zhang, Ye-Gui
AU  - Gong, Xin
AU  - Hou, Liang-Qin
