TI  - Single-blinded, randomised preliminary study evaluating the effects of 2 Hz electroacupuncture for postoperative pain in patients with total knee arthroplasty.
AU  - Tzeng, Chung-Yuh
AU  - Chang, Shih-Liang
AU  - Wu, Chih-Cheng
AU  - Chang, Chu-Ling
AU  - Chen, Wen-Gii
AU  - Tong, Kwok-Man
AU  - Huang, Kui-Chou
AU  - Hsieh, Ching-Liang
