TI  - [Regulation effects of electroacupuncture at "Sanyinjiao" (SP 6) on bladder function in rats with overactive bladder after cystostomy].
AU  - Yang, Jing
AU  - Dai, Xiu
AU  - Wu, Yang
AU  - Yang, Xiao-dong
AU  - Hu, Ka-ming
AU  - Xiang, Bo
T2  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
JF  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
