TI  - Effects of P6 acustimulation with the ReliefBand on postoperative nausea and vomiting in patients undergoing gynecological laparoscopy.
AU  - Ertas, Gamze
AU  - Bengi Sener, Elif
AU  - Kaya, Cengiz
AU  - Ozkan, Fatih
