TI  - An Evaluation of Electroacupuncture at the Weizhong Acupoint (BL-40) as a Means of Relieving Pain Induced by Extracorporeal Shock Wave Lithotripsy.
AU  - Chen, Wei-Ta
AU  - Chang, Fang-Chia
AU  - Chen, Yi-Hung
AU  - Lin, Jaung-Geng
