TI  - [Effects of electroacupuncture stimulation at "Guanyuan" (CV 4) on serum insulin-like growth factor-1 content and bone biomechanics in ovariectomy-induced osteoporosis rats].
AU  - Zhang, Mu-Lan
AU  - Li, Pei
AU  - Lin, Ying
AU  - Ji, Feng
