TI  - [Application of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation combined with infusion of propofol in anodynia bronchoscopy].
AU  - Qi, Sheng
AU  - Wu, Xin-Qin
AU  - Lu, Xiao-Bo
T2  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
JF  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
