TI  - [Effects of transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation combined with general anesthesia on cerebral oxygen metabolism in elderly hip replacement patients during controlled hypotension].
AU  - Yuan, Lan
AU  - Tang, Wei
AU  - Wang, Jian
AU  - Fu, Guo-Qiang
