TI  - Effect of perioperative electroacupuncture as an adjunctive therapy on postoperative analgesia with tramadol and ketamine in prostatectomy: a randomised sham-controlled single-blind trial.
AU  - Ntritsou, Vagia
AU  - Mavrommatis, Christos
