TI  - [Influence of electroacupuncture intervention on serum ghrelin content and bone mineral density in ovariectomized rats].
AU  - Ou-Yang, Gang
AU  - Tang, Xi
AU  - Mo, Fei
AU  - Ge, Wei
AU  - Hou, Li-Hao
AU  - Lou, Qing-Lin
