TI  - [Effect of transcutaneous acupoint electric stimulation on perioperative intravenous anesthesia in patients of transsphenoidal pituitary tumor resection].
AU  - Chen, Xue
AU  - Wang, Bao-Guo
AU  - Li, Jin
AU  - An, Li-Xin
T2  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
JF  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
