TI  - Effects of electroacupuncture on bone mineral density, oestradiol level and osteoprotegerin ligand expression in ovariectomised rabbits.
AU  - He, Jing
AU  - Yang, Lin
AU  - Qing, Yuxi
AU  - He, Chengqi
