TI  - Integrative acupoint stimulation to alleviate postoperative pain and morphine-related side effects: a sham-controlled study.
AU  - Chung, Yu-Chu
AU  - Tsou, Mei-Yung
AU  - Chen, Hsing-Hsia
AU  - Lin, Jaung-Geng
AU  - Yeh, Mei-Ling
