TI  - Effects of electroacupuncture at auricular concha region on the depressive status of unpredictable chronic mild stress rat models.
AU  - Liu, Ru-Peng
AU  - Fang, Ji-Liang
AU  - Rong, Pei-Jing
AU  - Zhao, Yufeng
