TI  - Cardioprotective effect of transcutaneous electric acupoint stimulation in the pediatric cardiac patients: a randomized controlled clinical trial.
AU  - Ni, Xinli
AU  - Xie, Yaning
AU  - Wang, Qiang
AU  - Zhong, Haixing
