TI  - [Protecting action of acupuncture-drug compound anesthesia with different frequency electroacupuncture on stress reaction in pneumonectomy].
AU  - Ma, Wen
AU  - Zhu, Yu-ming
AU  - Zhou, Hong
AU  - Fu, Guo-qiang
AU  - Pan, Hong
AU  - Shen, Wei-dong
T2  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
