TI  - [Analgesic effect of acupuncture at Neimadian(Extra) in postoperation of abdominal surgery].
AU  - Ding, Liu-Xin
AU  - Xing, Qun-Zhi
AU  - Sun, Jun-Jun
AU  - Li, Yu
