TI  - [Experimental study on anti-inflammatory and analgesic effects of electroacupuncture combined with medium frequency therapy in model rats with lumbar nerve root compression].
AU  - Zhu, Feng
AU  - Ai, Bing-Wei
AU  - Gao, Jian-Yun
T2  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
JF  - Zhongguo zhen jiu = Chinese acupuncture & moxibustion
