TI  - [Effects of electroacupuncture of different acupoint groups on sevoflurane anesthesia in patients undergoing resection of supratentorial tumors].
AU  - An, Li-Xin
AU  - Li, Jin
AU  - Ren, Xiu-Jun
AU  - Liu, Yun-Ning
AU  - Wang, Bao-Guo
T2  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
JF  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
