TI  - Transcutaneous electrical nerve stimulation on ST36 and SP6 acupoints prevents hyperglycaemic response during anaesthesia: a randomised controlled trial.
AU  - Man, Kee-Ming
AU  - Man, Samantha S
AU  - Shen, Jui-Lung
AU  - Law, Kim-Seng
AU  - Chen, Shun-Liang
AU  - Liaw, Wen-Jinn
AU  - Lee, Chao-Te
AU  - Lee, Yuan-Ju
