TI  - Plasma adrenaline increases in anesthetized patients given electro-acupuncture before surgery.
AU  - Kvorning, Nina
AU  - Akeson, Jonas
T2  - Pain medicine (Malden, Mass.)
JF  - Pain medicine (Malden, Mass.)
