TI  - [Effects of electroacupuncture of "Shenmen" (HT 7) and "Taixi" (KI 3) on cardiac sympathetic activities in acute myocardial ischemia rabbits].
AU  - Wu, Zi-jian
AU  - Cai, Rong-lin
AU  - Long, Di-he
AU  - He, Lu
AU  - Hu, Ling
