TI  - [Preventive effect of transcutaneous electro-acupuncture on the intratracheal extubation stress response in general anesthesia of patients with breast cancer undergoing modified radical mastectomy].
AU  - Yu, Hui-chang
AU  - Geng, Wu-jun
AU  - Tang, Hong-li
T2  - Zhongguo Zhong xi yi jie he za zhi Zhongguo Zhongxiyi jiehe zazhi = Chinese journal of integrated traditional and Western medicine
