TI  - Immediate effects of acupuncture on gait patterns in patients with knee osteoarthritis.
AU  - Lu, Tung-wu
AU  - Wei, I-pin
AU  - Liu, Yen-hung
AU  - Hsu, Wei-chun
AU  - Wang, Ting-ming
