TI  - [Effects of electroacupuncture on bispectral index and plasma beta-endorphin in patients undergoing colonoscopy].
AU  - Ni, Yu-Fei
AU  - Li, Jun
AU  - Wang, Ben-Fu
AU  - Jiang, Song-He
AU  - Chen, Yi
AU  - Zhang, Wei-Feng
AU  - Lian, Qing-Quan
