TI  - [Effects of acupoint-nerve block on mast cell activity, manual acupuncture- and electroacupuncture-induced analgesia in adjuvant arthritis rats].
AU  - Huang, Hong
AU  - Zhan, Rui
AU  - Yu, Xiao-jia
AU  - Zhang, Di
AU  - Li, Wei-min
AU  - Ding, Guang-hong
