TI  - [Effect of capsaicin-pretreatment on "Sibai" (ST 2)-electroacupuncture induced changes of c-fos expression in rat caudal spinal trigeminal nucleus].
AU  - Liu, Jian-hua
AU  - Fu, Wen-bin
AU  - Yan, Jie
T2  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
JF  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
