TI  - [Observation on therapeutic effect of compound anesthesia of transcutaneous electrical point stimulation and Remifentanil].
AU  - Ou, Jin-Yan
AU  - Hong, Hai
AU  - Wang, Wen-Lan
AU  - You, Yu-Yuan
