TI  - [Effects of electroacupuncture of "Zusanli" (ST 36), "Hegu" (LI 4) and/or "Sanyinjiao" (SP 9) on immunofunction in gastric carcinectomy rats].
AU  - Lai, Min
AU  - Wang, Shu-mei
AU  - Wang, Ying
