TI  - [Effect of electroacupuncture on thymocyte apoptosis-related genes in morphine withdrawal rats].
AU  - Song, Xiao-ge
AU  - Zhu, Yong-lei
AU  - Zhang, Rong-jun
AU  - Zhang, Yao
AU  - Liu, Xian-hua
T2  - Zhen ci yan jiu = Acupuncture research
