TI  - [Effect of transcutaneous acupoint electrical stimulation on blood bioactive compounds involving cerebral injury during craniotomy].
AU  - Wang, Jun-lu
AU  - Ren, Qiu-sheng
AU  - Shen, Cai-cheng
AU  - Xie, Wen-xia
AU  - Zheng, Rui-xian
