TI  - Monitoring of neuromuscular blockade at the P6 acupuncture point reduces the incidence of postoperative nausea and vomiting.
AU  - Arnberger, Michael
AU  - Stadelmann, Karin
AU  - Alischer, Petra
AU  - Ponert, Regina
AU  - Melber, Andrea
AU  - Greif, Robert
T2  - Anesthesiology
