TI  - The effect of electroacupuncture on opioid-like medication consumption by chronic pain patients: a pilot randomized controlled clinical trial.
AU  - Zheng, Zhen
AU  - Guo, Runxiang J
AU  - Helme, Robert D
AU  - Muir, Andrew
AU  - Da Costa, Cliff
AU  - Xue, Charlie C L
