TI  - Acupuncture as an adjunct for sedation during lithotripsy.
AU  - Wang, Shu-Ming
AU  - Punjala, Mamatha
AU  - Weiss, Dana
AU  - Anderson, Kevin
AU  - Kain, Zeev N
