TI  - Perioperative auricular electroacupuncture has no effect on pain and analgesic consumption after third molar tooth extraction.
AU  - Michalek-Sauberer, Andrea
AU  - Heinzl, Harald
AU  - Sator-Katzenschlager, Sabine M
AU  - Monov, Gabriel
AU  - Knolle, Erich
