TI  - Metaanalysis of acustimulation effects on postoperative nausea and vomiting in children.
AU  - Dune, Linda S
AU  - Shiao, Shyang-Yun Pamela K
T2  - Explore (New York, N.Y.)
JF  - Explore (New York, N.Y.)
