TI  - Optimal timing of acustimulation for antiemetic prophylaxis as an adjunct to ondansetron in patients undergoing plastic surgery.
AU  - White, Paul F
AU  - Hamza, Mohamed A
AU  - Recart, Alejandro
AU  - Coleman, Jayne E
AU  - Macaluso, Amy R
AU  - Cox, Lyndsey
AU  - Jaffer, Omar
