TI  - Pain relief during oocyte retrieval with a new short duration electro-acupuncture technique--an alternative to conventional analgesic methods.
AU  - Humaidan, Peter
AU  - Stener-Victorin, Elisabet
T2  - Human reproduction (Oxford, England)
