TI  - Effects of auricular acupuncture-like transcutaneous electric nerve stimulation on pain levels following wound care in patients with burns: a pilot study.
AU  - Lewis, S M
AU  - Clelland, J A
AU  - Knowles, C J
AU  - Jackson, J R
